    "body": "partial fix on issue/31-wasm-ui · draft PR #285 (Refs #31, does not close) · proved by a local run of `web/build-app-wasm.sh`, which links camcraft-cli.wasm · merges when reviewed.\n\nRung 1 is done: camcraft-app, flecs' C included, now builds and links for wasm32-unknown-unknown. The pinned wasi-sysroot 34 supplies libc, and three checked edits to copies of the flecs crates are applied through `cargo --config patch` for that build only. Native builds are untouched. The manual `wasm` CI job runs the script.\n\nStill owed for \"UI runs in a browser\": egui-winit 0.36.2 does not compile for wasm32 (`DroppedFile::bytes_async` missing), so the browser shell needs eframe's web runner. After that come async GPU bring-up (the pollster sites), async file dialogs (the rfd sites), a `web_time` seam for Instant, inline fallbacks where threads are spawned, a JS shim for the nine wasi imports, and pinning wasm-bindgen CLI 0.2.129. The full list is in docs/decisions/31-wasm-ui.md.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
